Package: ccnlcob
Title: Analysis of COB Microdata by National Collective Labour Agreement (CCNL)
Version: 0.7.0
Date: 2026-09-09
Authors@R:
    person("Giampaolo", "Montaletti", , "giampaolo.montaletti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-5327-1122"))
Description: Analyses employment-relationship microdata from the Italian
    mandatory communications system (COB, Comunicazioni Obbligatorie) by
    national collective labour agreement (CCNL). Ranks agreements by number
    of hired workers and by effective working days, distributes them across
    public employment offices (CPI, Centro per l'Impiego) and across contract
    types, and tracks the evolution of the median declared wage by hiring
    cohort. Consumes relationships already classified by 'cnelR' and returns
    precomputed data.tables for dashboards and reports.
